{"id":"n52143-2-6","stage":0,"title":"똑같이 · 一模一样","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n52143-2-6-1","ko":"민준이랑 승규는 이상형이 똑같이 닮았어.","zh":"敏俊和承奎理想中的对象长得一模一样。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준이랑","meaning":"敏俊和","explanation":"민준：人名“敏俊”；-이랑 表示“和”，与后面的 승규 并列。","readings":[{"term":"민준이랑","audio":"/audio/51fe8c7e5b3a50dbeb63.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준이랑","audio":"/audio/51fe8c7e5b3a50dbeb63.mp3"}},{"text":"승규는","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：人名“承奎”；-는 标记话题。","readings":[{"term":"승규는","audio":"/audio/8cca37774e5e7081db86.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규는","audio":"/audio/8cca37774e5e7081db86.mp3"}},{"text":"이상형이","meaning":"理想型","explanation":"이상형：理想中的伴侣类型；-이 标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이상형","audio":"/audio/fd211e0f4f7224b10391.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72005","senseId":"1","lemma":"이상형","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이상형이","audio":"/audio/c14dc8fb341c40117c74.mp3"}},{"text":"똑같이","meaning":"一模一样地","explanation":"똑같이：一模一样地；修饰后面的 닮다，强调外貌相像。","readings":[{"term":"똑같이","audio":"/audio/e74adcf2ade3b11e71c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"52143","senseId":"2","lemma":"똑같이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"똑같이","audio":"/audio/e74adcf2ade3b11e71c7.mp3"}},{"text":"닮았어.","meaning":"长得像","explanation":"닮다：相像；-었- 在这里描述已呈现出的相似状态，-어 是非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"닮다","audio":"/audio/593cd68a248859878955.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73354","senseId":"1","lemma":"닮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"닮았어","audio":"/audio/5b7aec1f1f4079125d32.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"fd211e0f4f7224b1","term":"이상형","zh":"理想型","audio":"/audio/fd211e0f4f7224b10391.mp3","entryId":"72005","definition":"理想中的伴侣类型；这里指两人心目中的对象。","pronunciation":["이ː상형"]},{"id":"e74adcf2ade3b11e","term":"똑같이","zh":"一模一样，很相似","audio":"/audio/e74adcf2ade3b11e71c7.mp3","entryId":"52143","definition":"人的相貌、态度、举止等很相像地。","pronunciation":["똑